Package: scwbRepresentation
Type: Package
Title: Provisional Representation Operations for scworkbench
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hendrik A.", "de Weerd", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dirkdeweerd.work@gmail.com")
Description: Explicitly activated provisional ABI v3 operation pack containing
    bounded Leiden clustering, parameter-axis-authenticated PCA, and
    contained-model UMAP fit and transform operations, and authenticated sparse
    kNN neighbor and pseudobulk operations for scworkbench. It is not the
    complete Representation pack or a standard-profile dependency.
