Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: scworkbench, igraph, irlba, Matrix, RANN, stats, uwot
Suggests: DBI, digest, fs, jsonlite, rnndescent, FNN
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
